&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp030000-asr_E02847-000:GovernanceTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E02847-000:StrategyTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;(2）戦略&lt;/p&gt;
